81-2101.
Act, how cited.
Sections 81-2101 to 81-2144 shall be known and may be cited as the State Electrical Act.
Source
Laws 1975, LB 525, § 1;
R.S.1943, (1976), § 81-571;
Laws 1986, LB 379, § 1;
